glucosamine/chondroitin to treat knee osteoarthritis"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Don’t rely on vitamin C to prevent colds"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Don’t get a whole-body PET-CT or tumor marker panel if you have no symptoms"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Don’t expect fitness trackers or smartwatches to help you lose weight"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Don’t pay a premium for organic food just to be “healthier”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Don’t spend a lot of money on health supplements, herbal formulas, or tonics to “improve your health”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Don’t take probiotics long-term if you have no gut problems"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Don’t force yourself to take cold showers just to “boost immunity”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Don’t buy products marketed for detox, colon cleansing, enzymes, or alkaline water"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Don’t force yourself to drink water just to hit “8 glasses a day”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Don’t spend money on fortune‑telling, tarot, or astrology to make decisions"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Don’t buy blue-light-blocking glasses to “protect your vision,” and don’t believe claims that staring at screens for months will ruin your eyes — but severe eye pain, redness, and swelling require immediate medical attention"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Don’t treat blood donation as a health habit: claims that it “detoxifies, lowers cholesterol, and prevents heart attacks” lack randomized trial support, while frequent donation truly causes iron deficiency"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Don’t rely on generic health check packages to prevent disease; instead, get the evidence‑based screenings appropriate for your age and gender"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Don’t start taking uric‑acid‑lowering drugs just because a checkup shows high uric acid but you’ve never had symptoms"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"Don’t have a gallbladder removed prophylactically just because an ultrasound found gallstones but you’ve never felt any pain"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Don’t cut calcium out to prevent kidney stones"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Don’t buy crystals, bracelets, or Pixiu figurines for “good luck,” “wealth attraction,” or “health benefits”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Don’t expect shopping to lift your mood or boost your sense of self-worth"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"Don’t spend extra money to “move up a rung” among your peers by buying a new house, car, or social circle"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-25"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"Don’t believe that “willpower is like a muscle that runs out after use”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-26"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"Don’t expect skipping breakfast or the 16:8 intermittent fasting method to help you control your weight; instead, pick a meal timing you can stick to long-term"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-27"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"Do not believe that \"masturbation harms the body\" or that \"abstinence is the only way to improve\"; what truly matters is whether it interferes with your sleep, work, and relationships"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/06-28","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"Do not spend money on \"conversion therapy\" or \"gay علاج,\" and do not send your family members to undergo it either"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-29"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"Do not expect “correct lifting posture” or lifting training to prevent back pain; reduce the weight and number of lifts, and exercise regularly"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-30"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"Do not expect extra calcium or bone broth to make a fracture heal faster"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-31"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"Don’t rely on an AI chatbot alone to judge a medical or legal problem; before seeing a doctor, going to court or spending big money, find the source it cites and check it against the original"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/06"},"children":["Chapter 6"," ·"," ","Items to avoid"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"06-28"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["28"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["Evidence"," ","B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Do not spend money on \"conversion therapy\" or \"gay علاج,\" and do not send your family members to undergo it either"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["After reviewing the research, a panel of experts from the American Psychological Association stated that this type of conversion cannot change sexual orientation and may cause harm. In a U.S. survey, nearly 90% of those who underwent conversion had experienced suicidal ideation. In China, a psychiatric hospital forcibly admitted a man under the guise of \"sexual preference disorder,\" and the court ruled it an infringement, awarding 5000 yuan in compensation."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost. What is saved is the revenue of conversion agenci…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["A working group report from the American Psychological Association 2009 years ago states that efforts to chang…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Do not spend money on \"conversion therapy\" or \"gay علاج,\" and do not send your family members to undergo it either"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost. What is saved is the revenue of conversion agencies, psychological clinics, and \"anti-gay\" organizations. The difficulty lies in family members insisting on sending them."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["A working group report from the American Psychological Association 2009 years ago states that efforts to change sexual orientation are \"unlikely to be successful and carry a certain risk of harm.\" Regarding sending minors to coercive or inpatient conversion programs, the report recommends that neither parents nor children should consider them. A nationally representative survey in the United States visited 1518 sexual minority adults, approximately 7% of whom had undergone conversion, with eighty percent coming from religious backgrounds. After adjusting for factors such as age and childhood adversity, the OR for having suicidal ideation in one's lifetime among those who underwent conversion was 1.92 (95% CI 1.01–3.64, as high as about ninety percent). The OR for having planned suicide was 1.75 (1.01–3.06). The OR for suicide attempts involving no injury or minor injury was 1.88 (1.01–3.50).Another study visited 245 young people aged 21 to 25. Among those whose adolescence was not corrected, 22.0% had attempted suicide. Among those whose parents personally attempted to change their child's sexual orientation, the figure was 48.1%. Among those whose parents also sent them to see therapists or religious figures, the figure was 62.8%. The World Health Organization's disease classification ICD-10 states: \"Sexual orientation itself is not considered a disorder.\" In 2017, the Yicheng District Court of Zhumadian, Henan, tried a case: a psychiatric hospital forcibly admitted a man under the name of \"sexual preference disorder.\" The court ruled that his \"condition was general, and there were no behaviors or dangers such as suicide, harming others, or destroying property, which do not meet the conditions for mandatory treatment.\" The court ordered the hospital to issue a public apology and pay mental distress compensation of 5000 yuan (USA / China)"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["American Psychological Association Task Force on Appropriate Therapeutic Responses to Sexual Orientation (2009). Report of the Task Force on Appropriate Therapeutic Responses to Sexual Orientation. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.apa.org/pi/lgbt/resources/therapeutic-response.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.apa.org/pi/lgbt/resources/therapeutic-response.pdf"]},"；Blosnich JR, Henderson ER, Coulter RWS, Goldbach JT, Meyer IH. (2020). Sexual Orientation Change Efforts, Adverse Childhood Experiences, and Suicide Ideation and Attempt Among Sexual Minority Adults, United States, 2016–2018. American Journal of Public Health, 110(7), 1024–1030. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.2105/AJPH.2020.305637","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.2105/AJPH.2020.305637"]},"；Ryan C, Toomey RB, Diaz RM, Russell ST. (2020). Parent-Initiated Sexual Orientation Change Efforts With LGBT Adolescents: Implications for Young Adult Mental Health and Adjustment. Journal of Homosexuality, 67(2), 159–173. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1080/00918369.2018.1538407","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1080/00918369.2018.1538407"]},"；World Health Organization. ICD-10 Version:2019, F66 Psychological and behavioural disorders associated with sexual development and orientation. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://icd.who.int/browse10/2019/en#/F66","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://icd.who.int/browse10/2019/en#/F66"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2018 年修正). 精神卫生法（第二十三、三十、七十八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7448a066d","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=2c909fdd678bf17901678bf7448a066d"]},"；广西壮族自治区人民检察院网站转载新京报 (2017). 驻马店「同性恋强制治疗案」终审. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gx.jcy.gov.cn/jblm/shgz/201709/t20170920_2068489.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gx.jcy.gov.cn/jblm/shgz/201709/t20170920_2068489.shtml"]},"；澎湃新闻 (2014-08-02). 首例“矫正同性恋”案在京审理，诊所被指有“三大罪状”（澎湃见习记者 周辰，实习生 尹瑞涛）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1259405","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1259405"]},"（网页存档 ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://web.archive.org/web/20261005044046/https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1259405","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://web.archive.org/web/20261005044046/https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1259405"]},"）；澎湃新闻 (2014-12-21). 中国进入多元性别时代：李银河“出柜”与电击中心败诉（澎湃新闻记者 周哲）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1287582","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1287582"]},"（网页存档 ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://web.archive.org/web/20261005044046/https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1287582","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://web.archive.org/web/20261005044046/https://www.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_1287582"]},"）；反方：Sullins DP. (2022). Sexual Orientation Change Efforts Do Not Increase Suicide: Correcting a False Research Narrative. Archives of Sexual Behavior, 51, 3377–3393. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10508-022-02408-2","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1007/s10508-022-02408-2"]},"；Blosnich JR, Coulter RWS, Henderson ER, et al. (2023). Correcting a False Research Narrative: A Commentary on Sullins (2022). Archives of Sexual Behavior, 52(3), 885–888. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10508-022-02521-2","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1007/s10508-022-02521-2"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.apa.org/pi/lgbt/resources/therapeutic-response.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Disputed. Sullins 2022 reanalyzed the same data, excluding suicidal thoughts that existed before conversion efforts. On that analysis, conversion efforts were no longer positively associated with suicidal thoughts (OR 0.44, 0.20–0.94). Sullins’s institution opposes homosexuality, and the original authors published a response. The magnitude of harm remains disputed, but no contrary evidence was found for the conclusion that sexual orientation cannot be changed this way. Rated B because the harm estimates all come from retrospective surveys. Legally, inpatient treatment is voluntary; compulsory admission is permitted only for severe mental disorders accompanied by a risk of harming oneself or others. Psychological counselors may not provide psychotherapy. Intentionally hospitalizing someone without a mental disorder for treatment creates liability for compensation. In 2014, a man sued after receiving hypnosis and electric-shock “treatment” for homosexuality at Chongqing Xinyu Piaoxiang Psychological Counseling Center. Beijing’s Haidian court ordered the center to apologize publicly and compensate his financial losses. Reports say the judgment stated that homosexuality is not a mental illness and that the center’s promise of a cure was false advertising. Only reporting by The Paper was found for this case; the original judgment was not found on the court’s website. If this issue causes persistent distress, visit psychiatry or clinical psychology with the aim of relieving that distress. For how a family should respond when a child comes out, see Section 30, Item 15 (a child says they like the same sex). The beneficiaries are you and your family."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/06-27"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"Do not believe that \"masturbation harms the body\" or that \"abstinence is the only way to improve\"; what truly matters is whether it interferes with your sleep, work, and relationships"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/en/tip/06-29"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Next"]},"Do not expect “correct lifting posture” or lifting training to prevent back pain; reduce the weight and number of lifts, and exercise regularly"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className"